# SellYourBrick design system

Always read `/DESIGN.md` before UI changes.

## Reference

International premium brokerage About pages: photo-led, serif display + sans body, generous whitespace.

## Accent

Tiffany `#0abab5` — labels, primary buttons, key stats, thin rules only. Not full-page backgrounds.

## Forbidden

Three.js / 3D, parallax, spinning elements, gradient headlines, glow shadows, icon feature grids, hover lift animations.

## Patterns

- Hero: full-bleed photo + bottom dark gradient + white Playfair title
- Sections: alternate white / `#f8fafc`
- Property types: 2×2 cards, image top, text bottom
- Prose max-width ~42rem
